ECS in private subnet connects to RDS via private DNS endpoint, allowed only via security group on port 3306. DB password is NOT in code, I store in Secrets Manager and ECS Task Role fetches it. RDS is Multi-AZ for HA, failover auto in 2 mins. S3 Standard for frequent assets, Glacier for backup. CloudFront caches static near user."